window.EN={"1":"Having fallen into Raydrik's hands, Leif","2":"is escorted to Munster by imperial soldiers.","3":"It lay under the rule of House Friege, entrusted with northern Thracia by the Emperor of Grannvale,","4":"and Baron Raydrik, a former general of the royal guard of the Kingdom of Connacht who won merit by secretly siding with the Empire,","5":"had been entrusted with governing it as a subordinate of Bloom, the head of House Friege, who resides in Connacht.","6":"What Leif saw there was...","7":"Heh heh heh. With this, my advancement is assured.","8":"Dalsin! Don't let that brat escape until they come from Connacht to collect him!","9":"...Yes, sir...","10":"I am going to the arena. Woman, you come along too.","11":"Why should I...","12":"Don't you want to see the girls?","13":"The girls? ...Mareeta and Nanna?","14":"That's right. Both of them are well.","15":"Don't worry. I haven't laid a finger on them.","16":"...Will you really let me see them?","17":"I promise.","18":"...Very well. Lead the way...","19":"That's more like it. Heh heh heh...","20":"......","21":"Brighton, you and the others rescue the people held in this dungeon.","22":"I will go with Asbel to look for the children.","23":"Understood. Once we've freed the citizens, we'll come to back you up.","24":"I see. Then we'll meet again later. I wish you good luck!","25":"Lara, your skill is the only thing we can rely on. You'll be all right?","26":"Yeah. Leave the lock-picking to me.","27":"But you'd better protect me properly.","28":"If worst comes to worst, just steal your opponent's weapon. You can manage that.","29":"Don't say it so lightly. I can't carry heavy weapons.","30":"Don't worry. Brighton and I are with you. Come on, let's go!","31":"Damn it... I've got no luck...","32":"Um... by any chance... aren't you Boss Lifis of the Lifis Pirates?","33":"Y-yeah, that's me...","34":"I knew it!","35":"See, you look just like the wanted poster, so I thought maybe...","36":"Heh heh... I'm pretty famous, huh... Wait... I can use this guy...","37":"Huh, what's wrong, Mr. Lifis? You've got an awfully serious look on your face...","38":"...Truth is, I was thinking up a way to break out of this cell.","39":"Whaat!? Can you do that?","40":"Idiot, think about it. The great me has been caught like this.","41":"There's no way my dear underlings would just sit by and watch.","42":"So I'll be saying goodbye before long. It won't be for long, but nice knowing you.","43":"I-if that's how it is, Mr. Lifis, please take me with you.","44":"Hmm... Well, depending on how you work, I might think about it.","45":"R-really!?","46":"Leave it to me. I'm confident in my muscle.","47":"A jailer like that, I'll flatten in one punch.","48":"Mr. Lifis, let me in on that too.","49":"Me too, me too.","50":"Heh heh... Idiots are easy to handle, which helps. Now, how to make my chance...","51":"Got lively all of a sudden. What did you get caught for?","52":"...Who are you?","53":"I'm Fergus. A wandering mercenary.","54":"Man, what a mess.","55":"A soldier was hassling a girl, so I tried to stop him and got arrested.","56":"It's a rotten deal, honestly.","57":"That was just \"trying to stop him\"?","58":"Poor guy, that soldier was half dead. Honestly, you're outrageous...","59":"Hey, hey, that's not fair. You're the one who stepped in to stop it first.","60":"And thanks to you, they thought I was with you and I got caught too!","61":"Geez, what are you going to do about it!? Take responsibility!","62":"Ahaha. Well, let's not fret over what's done.","63":"Yaaawn. I'm getting kind of sleepy. Wake me up when it's mealtime. See ya.","64":"Geez, what a guy, honestly...","65":"Oh, sorry. My name's Karin. Nice to meet you.","66":"Karin? ...That's an unusual name in Thracia.","67":"I came from Silesse. I only just arrived in this town.","68":"And yet, thanks to this guy, I've had a terrible time.","69":"Silesse... That's a country far to the north. I've only heard the name.","70":"What did you come from Silesse for?","71":"Our prince left the country.","72":"The Queen has passed away, and the princess is still young,","73":"so we didn't know what to do anymore, and I came to look for the prince.","74":"I heard the Kingdom of Silesse was destroyed by the Empire, but is the royal family safe?","75":"Yes. Those who oppose the Empire","76":"moved to a town far in the north called Tófa, and have kept protecting the royal family.","77":"Someday I'll become a pegasus knight of the royal guard and help them, too.","78":"That's amazing. If you'll be a pegasus knight, then you can fly.","79":"Yeah, I can fly.","80":"I'm not a knight yet, so just flying is all I can manage, but my pegasus and I understand each other.","81":"His name is Hermes.","82":"He's really cute, and smart, too.","83":"Even now, I think he's circling in the sky looking for me.","84":"So why did the prince leave the country?","85":"He said he was going to look for the King... But the King is a strange person,","86":"he leaves his country and family to themselves and hasn't been in the country for ages.","87":"Everyone's angry. They say they don't expect anything from the King anymore.","88":"So we want Prince Ced to come back and become king.","89":"That's why I came to bring him home, but thanks to this guy...","90":"Thanks to who?","91":"Can't you keep it down a little? This is a prison. You're bothering everyone who's sleeping.","92":"You're about the only one who could snore away in a situation like this.","93":"Geez, you really are insensitive!","94":"Hey! You lot are noisy! Keep quiet!!","95":"See, we got told off. Ahahaha...","96":"Hmph...","97":"......","98":"You seem kind of gloomy. Tell me about it if you like. I'll help you out.","99":"...Right. If it's you two...","100":"Cough, cough, cough...","101":"Granny, are you all right?","102":"There's no need to worry about me. I haven't long to live anyway. More than that, my grandchild... cough, cough, cough...","103":"Now, now, you mustn't push yourself. Just lie down, Granny.","104":"Even an old woman like that...","105":"That's right. That's why we can't let those people keep throwing their weight around forever.","106":"But... can the Magi Squad's strength really overturn the Empire's rule?","107":"It won't be easy.","108":"But if we don't do it, the chance is zero.","109":"So there's nothing for it but to believe in that man.","110":"The hero... Lord Ced...","111":"That's right.","112":"Before he showed up, the Magi Squad had been cornered by the Empire's lot and was on the brink of destruction.","113":"And how about now?","114":"They've become a force that can give that lot a real scare, haven't they?","115":"...Not that I'm one to talk big, having gotten caught.","116":"Anyway, believe in him.","117":"As long as you believe in him, you can't go wrong.","118":"Mr. Lifis, the lock's open! Amazing, it's just like you said!","119":"......","120":"Huh, what's wrong?","121":"Your underlings came to save you, aren't you happy?","122":"N-no, that's not it...","123":"Hey, hey, did someone really come to the rescue... Guess it pays to talk big...","124":"Prince Leif, looks like someone's come to rescue us. Shall we make our escape too?","125":"Who on earth are they?","126":"Think about that after we're out. For now, just run.","127":"If you get to the \"north stairs\" you can escape. I'll hold off the enemy, so you go on ahead, Prince.","128":"But if I escape, what happens to you all?","129":"Everyone left behind will be captured, I guess. Well, as long as the prince is safe, that's fine.","130":"I can't do that!","131":"I will \"escape\" only after everyone else has \"escaped\"!","132":"Heh... You're gonna make me cry.","133":"Well, fine. I'll stick with you for a while too.","134":"Now that I've heard your story, I can't just leave you.","135":"Hmm. You're a better man than you look.","136":"Fallen for me?","137":"D-don't say stupid things!!","138":"I'm joking. So, what'll you do?","139":"I hear the Magi Squad's leader is a guy called Ced.","140":"Isn't he the prince you're looking for?","141":"Yes, probably. But right now I'm worried about Lord Leif.","142":"Taking girls hostage... that Raydrik is absolutely unforgivable.","143":"I'll help with the rescue too.","144":"You? ...Can you fight?","145":"I'm not confident, but I'll do my best!","146":"Phew... What a pain. Now there are too many people to protect. This'll be rough...","147":"Our comrades are here, this is our chance! Everyone, let's get out!","148":"I'm sure there were stairs up to the surface in the west corridor. Head for those!","149":"Oh, you're from the Magi Squad. We're grateful. Everyone, let us make our escape.","150":"I believe there were stairs in the east corridor we could escape by.","151":"What!? Even my little brother, in the child hunt!?","152":"I see... I'm in your debt.","153":"I'm fed up with the Empire and with Raydrik both.","154":"I'll entrust my life to you!","155":"Veld, is the child hunt progressing?","156":"Yes, Lord Manfroy. There was resistance from some residents, but otherwise it is going smoothly.","157":"Then all that remains is the city of Tahra.","158":"If they absolutely refuse, I don't care. Burn the whole city.","159":"It will serve as an example for the future. Show no mercy.","160":"Yes. That is my intention.","161":"However, the generals of House Friege seem to be hesitant,","162":"and though they have surrounded it, it remains untouched.","163":"Princess Ishtar.","164":"Your father appears to lack the will to fight. What does he intend?","165":"My father is troubled.","166":"It is because many of his chief vassals oppose the child hunts.","167":"Of course, my brother and I also strongly oppose this matter.","168":"Archbishop Manfroy, I beg of you. Please stop the child hunts.","169":"To tear children of such a tender age away from their parents is too cruel.","170":"And to make them sacrifices to the god Loptous is no act for a human being!","171":"Ishtar, are you not misunderstanding something?","172":"I am not saying to kill the children.","173":"I only want to educate them and make them into people fit for my empire.","174":"Those who endure the trials will become subjects of the Empire and rule over the lowly humans.","175":"In other words, they will become the new nobility.","176":"This is a chance to seize happiness.","177":"Made to hate one another and fight, and only by surviving are they recognized as subjects of the Empire...","178":"Can that be called happiness?","179":"...Well, never mind. You'll understand too, in time.","180":"More importantly, Ishtar, there's a beautiful flower bed in the back garden. Let's go see it together.","181":"...Lord Julius...","182":"You people, I'm telling you for your own good. Go back to your cells!","183":"Diana... Your brother can't come home... Take care... of Hubert...","184":"Soft-hearted people... But I owe you one now."};
